      "Datasheet identity is PMBT3906 PNP switching transistor, Rev. 06 \u2014 2 March 2010.",
      "Table 7 is specified at Tamb = 25 degC unless otherwise specified. hFE entries are minimum values except the IC = -10 mA row, which also specifies a maximum of 300.",
